      "side": 1,
      "message": "Looks like the logic here is not correct, and results in build failure while running `aidl` for `CtsCorpOwnedManagedProfile` module. This happens because when optimize.enabled is cleared, the module that fails will not depend on `framework` and aidl compiler will be be invoked without then correct aidl include libraries (framework/*). We haven\u0027t seen it before because it has been masked by the bug being by this CL. I have verified that explicitly adding `framework` to the `libs` list of the `CtsCorpOwnedManagedProfile` fixes the problem, but I am not sure this is the right approach. Please advise",
